gantt
    accTitle: Illustrative documentation schedule
    accDescr: Drafting starts on January 5, 2026 and takes two calendar days. Review follows for one day, then revision for one day.
    title Documentation schedule (illustrative)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d
    tickInterval 1day
    section Preparation
    Draft content :draft, 2026-01-05, 2d
    section Review
    Review content :review, after draft, 1d
    Revise content :revise, after review, 1d
